      "writtenOn": "2022-10-27T18:29:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. git-sync-deps is still necessary for GN, and I don\u0027t want to change its behavior.\n\nFurthermore, Bazel doesn\u0027t download the git repositories to third_party/externals (which is where git-sync-deps does); it downloads them to the Bazel cache, which is hidden away from the user. We cannot control where Bazel downloads them.",
