      "writtenOn": "2022-10-27T18:29:41Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I intentionally did not want to incur any dependencies outside the standard library because I want this code to compile without needing to sync anything. If we needed to bootstrap the script (run it without Bazel) because the WORKSPACE.bazel got corrupted or something, then I don\u0027t want to have to go get or go install any deps. It seems simpler to have a script with no external dependencies.",
